Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.34,0:01:35.76,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.76,0:01:39.93,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.93,0:01:44.31,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.31,0:01:50.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:56.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.07,0:01:58.82,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.82,0:02:04.70,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.70,0:02:07.75,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.75,0:02:13.59,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.59,0:02:16.68,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.68,0:02:19.34,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.34,0:02:25.06,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.10,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.86,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.86,0:02:33.73,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.73,0:02:36.45,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.45,0:02:43.41,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:18.81,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5}A lua se afasta durante o amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:25.44,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}escondendo-se na brilhante luz forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:31.74,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Minhas emoções dão voltas infinitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:38.87,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,800)\blur5}enquanto tento conectar um coração ao outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:54.34,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Uma oração distante...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.93,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Se a paz em que acreditávamos fosse uma mentira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:23:02.56,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H51AFC3&}enganarei meu coração com tudo que tenho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:07.36,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}e vestirei a mim mesma com um fogo inspirador!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:10.78,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}O jardim da criação não causa mais que destruição
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:15.37,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}mesmo tendo uma espada de dois gumes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:20.18,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}continue lutando com tudo que tem...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:25.29,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\blur5\3c&HB2B865&}Meu pequeno trapaceiro!
